.TH "IMPACTLINE" "1" "Aug 2026" "Impactline" "Impactline Manual"

.SH NAME
impactline-history - Show Git history signals for a file


.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBimpactline history  [flags]\fP


.SH DESCRIPTION
Show churn and co-change frequency for a file or directory, computed
over the last 90 days or the last 200 commits touching it, whichever is
smaller.  defaults to "." (the current directory) if omitted.


.SH OPTIONS
\fB-h\fP, \fB--help\fP[=false]
	help for history

.PP
\fB--json\fP[=false]
	output machine-readable JSON

.PP
\fB-o\fP, \fB--output\fP=""
	write the report to this file instead of stdout


.SH SEE ALSO
\fBimpactline(1)\fP


